--   code     = the number you dial on the phone (cheats.xtbl <Number>)
--   toggle   = true when the cheat switches something on/off rather than doing it once.
--              INFERRED from the action text, not read from the game: Give/Drop/Set_To/
--              Set_Hour/Set_Player_Character/Restore/Clear/Instant/Max/Add/Remove/Repair
--              are one-shot, everything else (NeverDie, InfiniteSprint, UnlimitedClip,
--              Infinite_Ammo, LowGravity, ...) is taken to be a toggle.
